-- The second ten: measured text and fit, turned text, flat strokes, inner shadow, an adjustment layer (frosted glass),
-- duotone, grain, new shapes, align and distribute, and a grid of copies.
create a canvas called launch, 1080 by 1350.

draw a rectangle called photo, 1080 by 760, at 540 380.
draw a circle called dot, 7 big, at 70 70.
copy the dot 8 times, 46 apart, 5 rows.
draw a rectangle called glass, 900 by 330, corners 40, at 540 760.
write "LAUNCH DAY" called title in Lilita One, at 540 720, fit 780.
write "Friday 20 November · doors at seven" called when in Jost, at 540 850, size 40.
draw a bubble called tag, 300 by 130, corners 36, at 850 150.
write "NEW!" called new in Lilita One, at 850 172, size 70, turned -6.
draw a hexagon called one, 70 big, corners 10, at 200 1090.
draw a heart called two, 130 big, at 420 1100.
draw a diamond called three, 70 big, at 700 1080.
draw an arrow called four, 170 by 110, at 900 1120.
align the one, the two, the three and the four to the middle.
distribute the one, the two, the three and the four horizontally.
write "Measured text wraps exactly where the line is full, because the compiler now knows every letter's width in every font." called body in Jost, at 540 1255, size 30, 880 wide, leading 1.3.
align the title and the when to the left.

on the front.
enamel the card in #10131f.
print @marilyn.jpg in the photo, duotone #1b1145 and #ff9a5a, focused at 0.5 0.2.
enamel the dot in #ffffff, 35% opacity.
shadow the glass, 20 down, blur 40, 55% opacity.
adjust the glass, blurred 18, brightness 1.15.
enamel the glass in #ffffff, 14% opacity.
stroke the glass in #ffffff, 2 wide, 45% opacity.
stroke the title in #1b1145, 8 wide.
enamel the title in a gradient from #fff3d6 to #ff9a5a, angled 90.
enamel the when in #ffffff.
shadow the tag, 8 down, blur 16, 40% opacity.
enamel the tag in #ff5d5d.
enamel the new in #ffffff.
enamel the one in #5ad1c9.
enamel the two in #ff5d8f.
enamel the three in #ffd166.
enamel the four in #8f7bff.
shadow the one and the two and the three and the four, inside, 6 down, blur 10, 45% opacity.
enamel the body in #c9cede.
grain the card, 0.22.
